<Base title="Ascribe" description="Ascribe is documentation written as code and checked like code, made by Bryo Studio: free, open source, and built into a website, plain Markdown and JSON.">
  <p class="eyebrow">Software by Bryo Studio</p>
  <h1>Ascribe</h1>
  <p class="lede">Documentation written as code, checked like code, and built into a website, plain Markdown and JSON from the same files.</p>

  <!-- SCREENSHOT SPOT: one picture of a page in the editor with a problem
